// ===== 瓦礫の王の声(ゴーレム声):機械っぽく、低くてドスの効いた声をその場で合成する(音声ファイルは使わない) =====
// しくみ:とても低いブザー音(のこぎり波+さらに1オクターブ下のうなり)を、母音の響き(フォルマント)の帯域に通して言葉にする。
// 喉が大きい感じを出すため響きの帯域を全体に低くずらし、「グルル」と唸る揺れ・石がこすれる低いゴロゴロ・暗く長いエコーを足す
function playGolemVoice(ac, dest, t0, P) {
  const out = ac.createGain();
  out.gain.value = P.vol;
  // エコー(暗く、長め)
  const dl = ac.createDelay(1.5), fb = ac.createGain(), wet = ac.createGain(), lp = ac.createBiquadFilter();
  dl.delayTime.value = P.echo.time; fb.gain.value = P.echo.fb; wet.gain.value = P.echo.mix;
  lp.type = 'lowpass'; lp.frequency.value = P.echo.lp;
  out.connect(dest); out.connect(dl); dl.connect(lp); lp.connect(fb); fb.connect(dl); lp.connect(wet); wet.connect(dest);
  // 粗さ:強めに歪ませてから段々に丸める(岩がきしむような硬さ)
  const crush = ac.createWaveShaper();
  const n = 2048, curve = new Float32Array(n);
  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const x = (i / (n - 1)) * 2 - 1; curve[i] = Math.round(Math.tanh(x * P.drive) * P.steps) / P.steps; }
  crush.curve = curve;
  // 低音を少し持ち上げて重く
  const body = ac.createBiquadFilter(); body.type = 'lowshelf'; body.frequency.value = 220; body.gain.value = 5;
  crush.connect(body); body.connect(out);
  // 「グルル」と唸る揺れ(声の大きさを遅く深く揺らす)
  const growlG = ac.createGain(); growlG.gain.value = 0.7;
  const gOsc = ac.createOscillator(); gOsc.type = 'triangle'; gOsc.frequency.value = P.growl.rate;
  const gDepth = ac.createGain(); gDepth.gain.value = P.growl.depth;
  gOsc.connect(gDepth); gDepth.connect(growlG.gain);
  growlG.connect(crush);
  // 声の元:のこぎり波 + 1オクターブ下の矩形波 + さらに下の正弦波(地鳴りのような底)
  const src = ac.createGain();
  const o1 = ac.createOscillator(); o1.type = 'sawtooth';
  const o2 = ac.createOscillator(); o2.type = 'square';
  const o3 = ac.createOscillator(); o3.type = 'sine';
  const o2g = ac.createGain(); o2g.gain.value = 0.45;
  const o3g = ac.createGain(); o3g.gain.value = 0.0; // 底の正弦波は響きを通さず、直接まぜる(下で接続)
  P.pitch.forEach(([t, f], i) => {
    const set = i === 0 ? 'setValueAtTime' : 'linearRampToValueAtTime';
    o1.frequency[set](f, t0 + t); o2.frequency[set](f / 2, t0 + t); o3.frequency[set](f / 2, t0 + t);
  });
  // 声のゆらぎ(機械なのに少しだけ揺れて不気味に)
  const vib = ac.createOscillator(); vib.frequency.value = 5.5;
  const vibD = ac.createGain(); vibD.gain.value = 1.2;
  vib.connect(vibD); vibD.connect(o1.frequency);
  o1.connect(src); o2.connect(o2g); o2g.connect(src);
  const env = ac.createGain();
  P.env.forEach(([t, v], i) => env.gain[i === 0 ? 'setValueAtTime' : 'linearRampToValueAtTime'](v, t0 + t));
  src.connect(env);
  // 底の正弦波(地鳴り)は声と同じ大きさの動きで、響きの外から足す
  const subEnv = ac.createGain();
  P.env.forEach(([t, v], i) => subEnv.gain[i === 0 ? 'setValueAtTime' : 'linearRampToValueAtTime'](v * P.sub, t0 + t));
  o3.connect(subEnv); subEnv.connect(growlG);
  // 響き(フォルマント)3本:キーフレームどおりに動かす。喉が大きい感じに全体を低くずらす(P.formMul)
  for (let k = 0; k < 3; k++) {
    const bp = ac.createBiquadFilter(); bp.type = 'bandpass'; bp.Q.value = [5, 8, 10][k];
    const g = ac.createGain();
    P.kf.forEach(([t, F, G], i) => {
      const set = i === 0 ? 'setValueAtTime' : 'linearRampToValueAtTime';
      bp.frequency[set](F[k] * P.formMul, t0 + t); g.gain[set](G[k] * P.formGain, t0 + t);
    });
    env.connect(bp); bp.connect(g); g.connect(growlG);
  }
  const noiseBuf = (len) => {
    const b = ac.createBuffer(1, Math.max(1, Math.floor(ac.sampleRate * len)), ac.sampleRate), d = b.getChannelData(0);
    for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = Math.random() * 2 - 1;
    return b;
  };
  // 石がこすれる低いゴロゴロ(声の間ずっと、うっすら)
  const rb = ac.createBufferSource(); rb.buffer = noiseBuf(P.voiceOff - P.voiceOn + 0.3);
  const rf = ac.createBiquadFilter(); rf.type = 'lowpass'; rf.frequency.value = 160;
  const rg = ac.createGain();
  rg.gain.setValueAtTime(0, t0 + P.voiceOn); rg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(P.rumble, t0 + P.voiceOn + 0.08);
  rg.gain.setValueAtTime(P.rumble, t0 + P.voiceOff); rg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, t0 + P.voiceOff + 0.3);
  rb.connect(rf); rf.connect(rg); rg.connect(out);
  rb.start(t0 + P.voiceOn);
  // 「k」(子音のはじけ。低めで重く)
  const kn = ac.createBufferSource(); kn.buffer = noiseBuf(0.06);
  const kf = ac.createBiquadFilter(); kf.type = 'bandpass'; kf.frequency.value = 1300; kf.Q.value = 1.2;
  const kg = ac.createGain(); kg.gain.setValueAtTime(1.2, t0); kg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, t0 + 0.06);
  kn.connect(kf); kf.connect(kg); kg.connect(crush);
  kn.start(t0);
  // 「ス…」(ある時だけ):息の擦れる音。ゴーレムなので少し低めのザラついた擦れ
  if (P.s) {
    const sn = ac.createBufferSource(); sn.buffer = noiseBuf(P.s.end - P.s.start + 0.05);
    const sf = ac.createBiquadFilter(); sf.type = 'highpass'; sf.frequency.value = P.s.hp;
    const sf2 = ac.createBiquadFilter(); sf2.type = 'lowpass'; sf2.frequency.value = 7000;
    const sg = ac.createGain();
    sg.gain.setValueAtTime(0, t0 + P.s.start);
    sg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(P.s.vol, t0 + P.s.start + 0.06);
    sg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(P.s.vol * 0.4, t0 + P.s.end - 0.15);
    sg.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(0, t0 + P.s.end);
    sn.connect(sf); sf.connect(sf2); sf2.connect(sg); sg.connect(out);
    sn.start(t0 + P.s.start);
  }
  [o1, o2, o3, gOsc, vib].forEach((o) => { o.start(t0 + P.voiceOn - 0.01); o.stop(t0 + P.voiceOff + 0.05); });
}
// 共通の声質(ゴーレム)
const GOLEM_BASE = { formMul: 0.8, formGain: 3.6, drive: 2.6, steps: 20, growl: { rate: 23, depth: 0.42 }, sub: 0.42, rumble: 0.3 };
